# # Module 11: Generate Prompts
#
# ## Overview
# The `generate_prompts.py` module is responsible for creating per-function prompt templates from the logic catalog generated by `build_logic_catalog.py`. This module transforms the structured catalog into AI-ready prompts that will be used in Stage 4 to generate the final code implementation.
#
# ## Key Functions
# - `generate_function_prompts()` - Create prompts for all functions in the catalog
# - `create_prompt_template()` - Generate a single function prompt template
# - `save_prompts_to_file()` - Save generated prompts to files
#
# ## Pipeline Integration
# ```
# Stage 3: build_logic_catalog.py → Logic Catalog (YAML)
#     ↓
# Stage 4: generate_prompts.py → Prompt Templates
#     ↓ 
# Stage 4: generator.py → Final Code Implementation
# ```

